WEBVTT

00:28:57.996 --> 00:29:01.316
But Xi Jinping also sees

00:29:01.356 --> 00:29:06.436
that a lot of the world
is not with NATO on this issue.

00:29:06.476 --> 00:29:10.516
141 countries, if I remember correctly,

00:29:10.556 --> 00:29:16.116
voted to censor the Russians
for their invasion of Ukraine

00:29:16.156 --> 00:29:18.676
at the United Nations General Assembly.

00:29:19.476 --> 00:29:22.116
But very large numbers of that 141

00:29:22.116 --> 00:29:25.916
are not on board with all
of these sanctions against Russia.

00:29:25.956 --> 00:29:27.996
They're happy with the diplomatic censure,

00:29:27.996 --> 00:29:30.476
but they need to continue
to work with the Russians.